# ShrekOS AI front-door shell — provenance pin (ADR-006 §3, docs/adr-006-slice5-front-door.md).
#
# The `shrek ai` shell is DERIVED from a digest-pinned mycolink-shell snapshot, capability-reduced at build
# time: host-execution, escalation, external-agent dispatch, and generic process-spawn surfaces are REMOVED
# from the shipped source tree (scripts/harden-mycolink-shell.py), then narrow Shrek adapters are added
# (scripts/shrek-shell-adapters.py: Shrek Memory API recall transport + file-backed system prompt). A
# sealed reproducible image cannot float on a sibling repo's HEAD, so both the source commit and the
# resulting hardened-tree digest are pinned here; scripts/vendor-agent-harness.sh reproduces the derivative
# and FAILS THE BUILD on any digest mismatch or any surviving exec primitive (the no-exec gate).
#
# The vendored tree is assembled into the Onion at build time and is NOT committed to this repo (it is
# git-ignored); this pin + the harden/adapter patchset + the no-exec gate ARE the committed provenance.
SOURCE_REPO=BuberryWorldwide/agent-harness
SOURCE_COMMIT=99e22569963c3df6c476adf08b1f8c144ce7960d
# sha256 over sorted "<relpath>:<file-sha256>" of the hardened+adapted *.py tree (deterministic — the
# harden/adapt steps use no timestamps or model). Regenerate + update on any patchset or source-pin change.
HARDENED_TREE_SHA256=bded0609e929e756a905ad2352c7fc70916bf85980bb81be0a53801451fd5e22
HARDENED_PY_FILES=56
